;===== date: 2026-01-16-001 =====================


M140 S0 ;Turn-off bed
M83
G92 E0 ; zero the extruder
G1 E-1.5 F1800
G2 I0 J1 Z46.5 F3000 ; lower z a little
M106 S0
M106 P2 S0
G90
G1 Z80 F20000 ; Move print head up 
G180 S9
M104 S0
M84
M73 P100 R0
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_END

